      "id": "a78fe7d9-76dd-4aca-bc06-eea82203432b",
      "name": "SABIMAN Dataset Memory",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.memoryBufferWindow",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        21104,
        4336
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const raw = $json.output ?? $json.text ?? $json.response ?? $json;\nlet p = raw;\nif (typeof raw === 'string') {\n  try { p = JSON.parse(raw); } catch (_) {\n    const a = raw.indexOf('{');\n    const b = raw.lastIndexOf('}');\n    if (a >= 0 && b > a) {\n      try { p = JSON.parse(raw.slice(a,b+1)); } catch (_) {}\n    }\n  }\n}\nif (!p || typeof p !== 'object') p = {answer:String(raw ?? '')};\nconst s = $('Build Gemini User Message').first().json;\nreturn [{json:{\n  success:p.success!==false,\n  mode:s.mode,\n  session_id:s.session_id,\n  dataset_session_id:s.dataset_session_id||'',\n  business_id:s.business_id||'',\n  app_session_id:s.app_session_id||'',\n  answer:p.answer||p.summary||'',\n  summary:p.summary||p.answer||'',\n  voice_output:p.voice_output||p.answer||p.summary||'',\n  findings:Array.isArray(p.findings)?p.findings:[],\n  recommendations:Array.isArray(p.recommendations)?p.recommendations:[],\n  kpis:Array.isArray(p.kpis)?p.kpis:[],\n  visualizations:Array.isArray(p.visualizations)?p.visualizations:[],\n  quick_questions:Array.isArray(p.quick_questions)?p.quick_questions:[]\n}}];"
      },
      "id": "aebb6849-9f5b-445f-8b7b-105f5417c52e",
      "name": "Build Frontend Response",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        21296,
        4096
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## SABIMAN WORKFLOW 2 — MEMORY DATASET EDA + TEXT/VOICE Q&A\n\nINITIAL DATASET HANDOFF\nWorkflow 1 → Workflow 2 Trigger → store dataset in Gemini memory → initial EDA → Return Initial EDA to Workflow 1.\n\nWorkflow 1 must be configured to WAIT for the Execute Workflow result, then return that result from its upload webhook to the frontend.\n\nFOLLOW-UP QUESTIONS\nFrontend → Workflow 2 /sabiman-chat → Gemini + same memory session → Respond to Frontend Webhook. Workflow 1 is NOT involved.\n\nSESSION\nMemory session key = dataset_session_id. New dataset = new dataset_session_id and therefore a separate memory.\n\nIMPORTANT\nOnly the initial_eda handoff requires csv_text. Text/voice questions do not send csv_text again.\n",
        "height": 800
      },
